WEBVTT

00:02:59.472 --> 00:03:01.971
I'm always the one taking the picture.

00:03:01.971 --> 00:03:04.426
So I want to encourage everyone today

00:03:04.426 --> 00:03:06.525
to get in the shot,

00:03:06.525 --> 00:03:09.304
and don't hesitate to go up to someone and ask,

00:03:09.304 --> 00:03:11.346
"Will you take our picture?"

00:03:11.346 --> 00:03:17.084
Thank you. (Applause)